<Base title="Services | Colorteam" description="Identity design, creative production, marketing and growth, and digital experiences from one team." image="/img/og-2026.jpg" page="page-expertise" navCurrent="/services/">
<div class="ct-page" id="page-expertise"><section class="section hero podcast-hero" id="expertise-top"><div aria-hidden="true" class="ct-hero-bg"><div class="ct-glow g"></div><div class="ct-glow p"></div><div class="ct-glow w"></div><div class="ct-grid"></div><div class="ct-noise"></div></div><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="hero-wrapper"><div class="inner-top-wrap"><div class="sub-title-wrap"><div class="new-text">Services</div><div class="inner-sub-title">What we do</div><img alt="" class="inner-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-right-lime.svg"/></div><h2 class="inner-title">Four Ways We Help You Grow</h2><p class="inner-details">Design gives marketing its soul, and marketing gives design its purpose. We bring both to every project.</p><div class="inner-button-wrap"><a class="primary-button w-inline-block is-green" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><div class="primary-btn-wrap"><div class="primary-btn-text-wrap _01"><div>Book a Call</div><img alt="" class="primary-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-up-right-dark.svg"/></div><div class="primary-btn-text-wrap _02"><div>Book a Call</div><img alt="" class="primary-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-up-right-dark.svg"/></div><div class="primary-btn-bg"></div></div></a><a class="watch-button w-inline-block" href="#expertise-process"><div class="watch-btn-wrap"><img alt="" class="watch-icon" src="/img/icons/play.svg"/><div class="watch-btn-text">How We Work</div></div><div class="watch-btn-bg"></div></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section ct-svcs" id="expertise-services"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="ct-proj-head"><h2 class="ct-proj-h">Our Services</h2><p>Each service works on its own, and they work best together: one team taking you from positioning to growth.</p></div><div class="ct-svc-list-wrap"><article class="ct-svc"><div class="ct-svc-num">01</div><div class="ct-svc-main"><img alt="" class="ct-svc-icon" src="/img/icons/service-brand-dark.svg"/><h3 class="ct-svc-title">Identity Design</h3><p class="ct-svc-desc">Brands that look like what they carry. We find your position, then build the identity and the system that keeps it consistent everywhere it shows up.</p></div><div class="ct-svc-side"><div class="ct-svc-label">What's included</div><ul class="ct-svc-list"><li>Brand strategy and positioning</li><li>Visual identity design</li><li>Brand guidelines and systems</li><li>Sub-brand and naming architecture</li></ul><div class="ct-svc-label">Seen in</div><div class="ct-svc-seen"><a class="ct-chip is-ghost" href="/blog/where-faith-meets-identity-the-kingdom-life-rebrand-case-study/">Kingdom Life Church</a><a class="ct-chip is-ghost" href="/blog/designing-a-conference-identity-that-scales-across-50-assets-the-neclive-2025-case-study/">NECLive 2025</a></div></div></article><article class="ct-svc"><div class="ct-svc-num">02</div><div class="ct-svc-main"><img alt="" class="ct-svc-icon" src="/img/icons/service-production-dark.svg"/><h3 class="ct-svc-title">Creative Production</h3><p class="ct-svc-desc">Content people actually stop for. From key art to motion and podcasts, we turn your story into assets built for each platform.</p></div><div class="ct-svc-side"><div class="ct-svc-label">What's included</div><ul class="ct-svc-list"><li>Video and podcast production</li><li>Motion graphics</li><li>Key art and campaign visuals</li><li>Visual storytelling</li></ul><div class="ct-svc-label">Seen in</div><div class="ct-svc-seen"><a class="ct-chip is-ghost" href="/blog/designing-a-conference-identity-that-scales-across-50-assets-the-neclive-2025-case-study/">NECLive 2025</a><a class="ct-chip is-ghost" href="/podcast/">The Colorteam Podcast</a></div></div></article><article class="ct-svc"><div class="ct-svc-num">03</div><div class="ct-svc-main"><img alt="" class="ct-svc-icon" src="/img/icons/service-growth-dark.svg"/><h3 class="ct-svc-title">Marketing &amp; Growth</h3><p class="ct-svc-desc">Go-to-market execution that compounds. We plan the campaigns, make the content and run the channels so visibility turns into revenue.</p></div><div class="ct-svc-side"><div class="ct-svc-label">What's included</div><ul class="ct-svc-list"><li>Campaign strategy</li><li>Content creation and marketing</li><li>Social media management</li><li>Ads management</li></ul><div class="ct-svc-label">Seen in</div><div class="ct-svc-seen"><a class="ct-chip is-ghost" href="/blog/bringing-africa-and-the-world-to-ostrava-the-afrostrava-case-study/">AfrOstrava Festival</a></div></div></article><article class="ct-svc"><div class="ct-svc-num">04</div><div class="ct-svc-main"><img alt="" class="ct-svc-icon" src="/img/icons/service-digital-dark.svg"/><h3 class="ct-svc-title">Digital Experiences</h3><p class="ct-svc-desc">Websites and products that do a job. Clear structure, sharp design and the analytics to keep improving after launch.</p></div><div class="ct-svc-side"><div class="ct-svc-label">What's included</div><ul class="ct-svc-list"><li>Web design and development</li><li>App design and UX/UI</li><li>SEO</li><li>Analytics and optimisation</li></ul><div class="ct-svc-label">Seen in</div><div class="ct-svc-seen"><a class="ct-chip is-ghost" href="/blog/bringing-africa-and-the-world-to-ostrava-the-afrostrava-case-study/">AfrOstrava Festival</a></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class="section ct-approach"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="ct-approach-eq"><span>Design</span><b>+</b><span>Marketing</span><b>=</b><span class="is-pink">Impact</span></div><p class="ct-approach-p">We don't see design and marketing as separate disciplines. They are two halves of the same conversation. Design is the visual and emotional language that makes strategy tangible and memorable, and marketing gives it reach, rhythm and results.</p></div></section><section class="section ct-process" id="expertise-process"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="ct-proj-head"><h2 class="ct-proj-h">How We Work</h2><p>Collaborative, transparent and agile. We become an extension of your team, from the first conversation to the results.</p></div><div class="ct-steps"><div class="ct-step"><span>01</span><h4>Discover</h4><p>We dive into your brand, goals and audience to find the real challenge and agree the scope together.</p></div><div class="ct-step"><span>02</span><h4>Strategy</h4><p>Key messages, audience, positioning and a roadmap, so every design and marketing decision has a purpose.</p></div><div class="ct-step"><span>03</span><h4>Design</h4><p>Strategy becomes identity, content and interfaces, crafted to resonate and to work.</p></div><div class="ct-step"><span>04</span><h4>Launch</h4><p>A controlled roll-out across every platform and channel, built for impact from day one.</p></div><div class="ct-step"><span>05</span><h4>Growth</h4><p>We monitor, learn and refine, so the brand keeps evolving and results keep compounding.</p></div></div><div class="ct-inds-wrap"><h3>Industries we serve</h3><div class="ct-inds"><span class="ct-ind">Tech &amp; SaaS</span><span class="ct-ind">Education &amp; Professional Services</span><span class="ct-ind">Fashion &amp; Lifestyle</span><span class="ct-ind">Finance &amp; Fintech</span><span class="ct-ind">Government &amp; Public Sector</span><span class="ct-ind">Faith-Based &amp; Nonprofit</span><span class="ct-ind">Media &amp; Entertainment</span><span class="ct-ind">Events &amp; Culture</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section ct-packs" id="expertise-products"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="ct-packs-head"><div class="ct-packs-eyebrow">Packages</div><h2 class="ct-packs-h">Pick your <span class="ct-pink">entry</span> point</h2><p class="ct-packs-p">Clear starting prices for individuals, businesses and agencies. Every project starts with a call, so we can scope it to your stage.</p></div><div class="pricing-inner-tabs w-tabs"><div class="ct-packs-tabs w-tab-menu"><a class="pricing-inner-tab-link w-tab-link w--current" data-tab="individuals" href="#"><div>For Individuals</div></a><a class="pricing-inner-tab-link w-tab-link" data-tab="businesses" href="#"><div>For Businesses</div></a><a class="pricing-inner-tab-link w-tab-link" data-tab="agencies" href="#"><div>For Agencies</div></a></div><div class="w-tab-content"><div class="w-tab-pane w--tab-active" data-pane="individuals"><div class="ct-pack-field"><div class="ct-pack-grid"><article class="ct-pack"><div class="ct-pack-top"><span class="ct-pack-num">01</span></div><h3 class="ct-pack-title">Brand kit</h3><p class="ct-pack-desc">A personal brand that looks as serious as your work.</p><div class="ct-pack-price"><span>From</span> $999</div><ul class="ct-pack-list"><li>Logo and wordmark</li><li>Colour palette and typography</li><li>Brand guidelines</li><li>Social profile kit</li><li>Colorteam Studio setup</li></ul><a class="ct-pack-btn" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Book a call</a></article><article class="ct-pack"><div class="ct-pack-top"><span class="ct-pack-num">02</span></div><h3 class="ct-pack-title">Website</h3><p class="ct-pack-desc">A personal site that turns a profile visit into a booked call.</p><div class="ct-pack-price"><span>From</span> $1,500</div><ul class="ct-pack-list"><li>Up to 5 pages</li><li>Page structure and design</li><li>Mobile-first build</li><li>SEO and analytics setup</li><li>Booking or contact form</li></ul><a class="ct-pack-btn" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Book a call</a></article><article class="ct-pack"><div class="ct-pack-top"><span class="ct-pack-num">03</span></div><h3 class="ct-pack-title">Social Templates</h3><p class="ct-pack-desc">Post on-brand every week without waiting on a designer.</p><div class="ct-pack-price"><span>From</span> $499</div><ul class="ct-pack-list"><li>20+ templates suitable for all social platforms</li><li>Posts, carousels and stories</li><li>Editable in Colorteam Studio</li></ul><a class="ct-pack-btn" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Book a call</a></article></div></div></div><div class="w-tab-pane" data-pane="businesses"><div class="ct-pack-field ember"><div class="ct-pack-grid"><article class="ct-pack"><div class="ct-pack-top"><span class="ct-pack-num">01</span></div><h3 class="ct-pack-title">Brand kit</h3><p class="ct-pack-desc">An identity system your whole team can use.</p><div class="ct-pack-price"><span>From</span> $2,999</div><ul class="ct-pack-list"><li>Positioning workshop</li><li>Logo system and variations</li><li>Colour, type and imagery rules</li><li>Full brand guidelines</li><li>Stationery and deck template</li><li>Colorteam Studio setup</li></ul><a class="ct-pack-btn" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Book a call</a></article><article class="ct-pack"><div class="ct-pack-top"><span class="ct-pack-num">02</span></div><h3 class="ct-pack-title">Website</h3><p class="ct-pack-desc">A site built to sell, not just to look good.</p><div class="ct-pack-price"><span>From</span> $4,500</div><ul class="ct-pack-list"><li>Up to 12 pages</li><li>Conversion-led page structure</li><li>CMS your team can edit</li><li>SEO, analytics and tracking</li><li>Launch support</li></ul><a class="ct-pack-btn" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Book a call</a></article><article class="ct-pack"><div class="ct-pack-top"><span class="ct-pack-num">03</span></div><h3 class="ct-pack-title">Social Templates</h3><p class="ct-pack-desc">One content system across every channel.</p><div class="ct-pack-price"><span>From</span> $1,200</div><ul class="ct-pack-list"><li>24 templates across 3 platforms</li><li>Posts, carousels, stories and ads</li><li>Video templates</li><li>Editable in Colorteam Studio</li></ul><a class="ct-pack-btn" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Book a call</a></article></div></div></div><div class="w-tab-pane" data-pane="agencies"><div class="ct-pack-field daylight"><div class="ct-pack-grid is-two"><article class="ct-pack is-wide"><div class="ct-pack-top"><span class="ct-pack-num">01</span></div><h3 class="ct-pack-title">White label</h3><p class="ct-pack-desc">Senior design capacity, delivered under your name.</p><div class="ct-pack-prices"><div class="ct-pack-price"><span>From</span> $1,500<small>per project</small></div><div class="ct-pack-price"><span>From</span> $2,000<small>a month</small></div></div><ul class="ct-pack-list"><li>Dedicated designer</li><li>Dedicated project manager</li><li>Delivery under your brand</li><li>Two revision rounds included</li><li>Retainers billed at the start of each month</li><li>NDA as standard</li></ul><a class="ct-pack-btn" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Book a call</a></article><article class="ct-pack is-steps"><h3 class="ct-pack-title">How it works</h3><ol class="ct-pack-steps"><li><b>Book a call.</b> Tell us what your clients need and when.</li><li><b>We scope it.</b> A fixed project price or a monthly capacity plan.</li><li><b>We deliver under your name.</b> Your designer and PM work in your tools, on your timeline.</li></ol></article></div></div></div></div></div><p class="ct-packs-note">Every brand kit includes setup in Colorteam Studio, so your team can make on-brand content in minutes.</p></div></section></div>
</Base>
